window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Aurora carries a huge secret with her. As a nanny, she is able to indulge both her love of children and her passion for reading. But no one knows her desires are bigger than her.<br> <br> In one life-changing moment, Aurora meets a strange cat, discovers a mysterious tree, and lands in a world that makes her feel like she's entered the afterlife. A royal family with 7 brothers in need of a—wait for it—nanny for all their children? What are the odds?<br> <br> Doc, Grumpy, Happy, Sleepy, Bashful, Sneezy, and Dopey share a fated heart that was broken by loss, but Fate intervenes by bringing them a nanny with a secret of her own, to help mend their family and their hearts.<br> <br> Will Aurora find the life she's dreamed of and be these brothers' fated heart, or will their grief reject their gift?</p>"; 
